    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Sonia Vecera",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102045718312346438826/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWOfB-QFi-8BCr53U0DWxHfQyvJKNQH2CW8YURHmTuNlfAIrWLykQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "I am very satisfied with this service. I’ve lived at this address in DDO for 26 years, and this is by far the best snow removal company I’ve dealt with.\nAn email is sent the day before a snowfall outlining the action plan followed by a text or email on the day of the snowfall advising to remove cars.\nMy driveway has never been this clean. I now even have space for an additional car—an area that was never cleared in previous years.\n\nMerci à vous!!",
        "time": 1769439882,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Suzie Belanger",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110704424729224896610/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL5rMaFFqGbTp1IDlHLM73d3HXWJL7e4utP75hX_IE-sAVK2w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "1 star because we can’t put 0…\nI am not a client but they have caused a lot of damage ($$$) on my property and refuse to take responsibility for anything (calls, emails, formal notice, etc.)\n\nAlso the driver that does the condos behind my house is very arrogant - no respect, he was waving at me while he was blowing the snow from the parking lot in my backyard (where my kids play). They already scrapped my pool last winter.",
        "time": 1768395085,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ri Zie",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117024450852788847273/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUnnBFgvJOyCPBFAlcV6AWR5V8JgqtfQQrVzwQoYXwOlgH2ui0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "in the last week",
        "text": "Subpar service where they either dont show up, show up once and not a second time after city plow passed or just wait until next day to show and even then do less than half baked job. I would give them zero if I could. No low peice is worth the headache.",
